      "text": "3. Having gone through the relief as sought for, without expressing any opinion on the merits of the case, the present application is finally disposed of with a direction to the court below to decide Ajeet Shukla vs State Of U.P. And Another on 6 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/33272163/\n1 aforesaid case in accordance with law, without granting unnecessary adjournments to either of the parties, as expeditiously as possible, preferably within a period of one year from the date of production of a certified copy of this order, if there is no legal impediment.",
